<title>MALAYSIA: Union Paper in &quot;material transaction&quot;.</title>
<headline>Union Paper in &quot;material transaction&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Paper Holdings Bhd said it is involved in talks on a &quot;material transaction&quot; and is seeking a continued suspension in its stock.</p>
<p>In a statement, the paper products concern did not provide any details on the transaction.</p>
<p>Shares of the company were suspended from February 19 at a last close of 17.80 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
